{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24794","headline":"和白太守拣贡橘 · 周元范","name":"和白太守拣贡橘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"离离朱实绿丛中，似火烧山处处红。\n影下寒林沈绿水，光摇高树照晴空。\n银章自竭人臣力，玉液谁知造化功。\n看取明朝船发後，余香犹尚逐仁风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周元范","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24794.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24794","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}